        "sid": "ISA 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Omukama yangambira ati, “Kwata ekishate kihango ky'eibare, okihandikeho omu nyuguta zihango oti, ‘Ebya Maherishalalihashibaazi.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nshuba nkwasa abajulizi babili abesigwa ab'okunjulira, atulimu Uria omukuhani na Zekaria eya Yeberekia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebiro kabyarabireho, omukazi wange omurangi atwara enda azara omwana w'omwojo. Ahanyuma Omukama angambira ati, “Eibara omwete Maherishalalihashibaazi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ahakuba orwo omwana aliba atakamanyire kugamba ati, ‘Tata’ anga ‘Mawe,’ eitunga lya Damasiko anga eminyago ya Samaria bilitwarwa omukama wa Asiria, agende nabifunya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama ashuba angambira ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Orwo abantu aba bangire amaizi ga Shiloa agalikugera mpora, bakatina Rezini na mutabani wa Remalia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "leba, Omukama naija kubasindikira engezi y'amani y'amaizi ga Efurati, engezi egyo n'iwe mukama wa Asiria n'ekitinwakye kyona. Amaizi ago garaijura gashage enyato zago n'ebisa byago byona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gagende nigakukumba buli kantu gatahe Yuda, gaijure gamareho ensi yona, gagobe omu bikya, gagobe buli hantu gamareho ensi yawe yona, iwe Emanueli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba Omukama Omushobora muno akantanga kurondora amahanga, ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekyo abanyamahanga tulinya bona tulikweta bushengi, muleke kukyeta bushengi. Kandi ekyo tulikutina mutakitina, mutakugira bwoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shana Omukama w'amahe mube n'iwe muha ekitinwa aha rw'obutakatifubwe, mube n'iwe mutina, abe n'iwe abagiza obwoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aliba bwirukiro, abe ibare elilyangwa, abe rwazi rw'okusitarwaho engoma za Yuda na Isiraeli, kandi abatuzi ba Yerusalemu ababere mutego n'ekitimba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atuli bangi tulimusitaraho; bagwe bahendeke, bakwatwe omutego, mara babatware endore.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamisiza kimoi Amateka aga, okomeleze abegesibwa bange bagakwate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama takinagira nju ya Yakobo lisho, kyonkai inye ndindiliire wenene, nimwesiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leba, inye n'abaana abo Omukama yantungire bali bumanyiso, mara bitangazo ebitairweho Omukama w'amahe, asingiire aha Ibanga lya Sioni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi kabarabaragira kuraguza aha tulikugambisa ebizimu n'aha bafumu atulikunywigya nibagambira omu matama, timulikumanya okwo abantu baragiirwe kwehanuza ahali Ruhanga? Abantu atulikurora babaragulize aha bafire? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emiku n'ebyo babegesa mube nibyo mwehanuzaho! Mazima aha rw'ekigambo eki ekyo tulikugamba titulibona mambya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baragenderaga elyo kushai, baina obushasi bungi n'enjara. Mara orwo barabaga baina enjara, baragiraga n'ekiniga kingi, bakene omukama wabo na Ruhanga wabo. Baliraramira eiguru ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anga balebe ahansi, babure eky'okubona, shana obushasi n'omwilima n'ekire ekisikiire. Ahanyuma tulinagwa omu mwilima elindindi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
